From: verkur46 <mohamadrezasahami1999@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 12:14:17 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 124/230] Polish Matchday: animate date strip taps, add missing
 Persian team names, fix Persian day abbreviations
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- DateStrip: change active scale to 0.96, add pressed background flash via
  active:bg-* variants, switch to min-h-11 (44px hit area), keep
  transition-colors duration-[var(--t-fast)] so the volt background fades in
  smoothly when switching days.
- names.ts: add Persian translations for every Top-5 league club in the seed
  data (Premier League, La Liga, Bundesliga, Serie A, Ligue 1), covering both
  Team.name and Team.shortName variants so localize() never falls back to
  English for any big-5 club.
- strings.ts: correct dates.day.sun in FA from "ال" to "ی" (یکشنبه →
  abbreviation ی).

